  "body_html": "<p>Transform any bedroom into a vibrant fan zone with the Jeminise Softball Lover Comforter Set. Designed for ultimate comfort and style, this bedding set celebrates the spirit of softball, making it a perfect gift for players, fans, and anyone who loves the game. Experience a soft, smooth, and durable feel that brings a relaxing atmosphere to your space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Show your passion for softball with a dynamic design, perfect for girls, women, and teens who love the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fade-Resistant:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process that helps the fabric retain its dye, preventing fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin, Full, Queen, and King to perfectly fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes a soft and cozy comforter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and dries quickly; simply tumble dry low.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Softball Lover Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Fade-Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
